# KN-011: Acid activity, not acid bottle amount, controls a sulfur clock
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.005mol
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.005mol
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.001mol
measure v2 ph
wait 10s
inspect
